	(text "These are labelled no connection, but they go off to the \nexternal RAM boards that house EPROMs, RAMs, address decoder\nlogic, etc. All of these are done with TTL-compatible\nCMOS PDIP chips. These particular connections go to the\nvarious chips which need a read/write enable, clock or reset\nsignal from the CPU."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 143.256 121.158 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "3ad75eb5-9ce4-4e9b-8233-a7cfd42faa98")
	)
	(text "These are labelled no connection, but they go off to the \nexternal RAM boards that house EPROMs, RAMs, address decoder\nlogic, etc. All of these are done with TTL-compatible\nCMOS PDIP chips. These particular signals are the 8 bit\ntri-stated data bus shared with all other tri-state chips."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 244.094 120.904 0)
