				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5768c542-9762-453b-8e0e-27abb4aec83b")
	)
	(text "These are labelled no connection, but they go off to the \nexternal RAM boards that house EPROMs, RAMs, address decoder\nlogic, etc. All of these are done with TTL-compatible\nCMOS PDIP chips. These particular connections go to the lower\n8 bits of the address lines to the various chips."
